OL,3,GNEWSAWater company issues first
OL,4,Ahosepipe ban in decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water company has announced its first
OL,7,Fhosepipe ban caused by drought in more
OL,8,Fthan 50 years.
OL,10,FBristol Water said the restriction -
OL,11,Fwhich bans people from using hosepipes
OL,12,Ffor watering gardens, washing cars or
OL,13,Ffilling paddling pools - would come
OL,14,Finto force from 00:01 BST on Thursday
OL,15,Fto protect the River Severn's
OL,16,Fresources.
OL,18,FHalf of the UK's water companies -
OL,19,Fincluding Wessex Water, Thames Water
OL,20,Fand South West Water - have now
OL,21,Fannounced hosepipe bans, as most of
OL,22,FEngland is in drought.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
