OL,3,GNEWSAWater company issues first
OL,4,Ahosepipe ban in decades
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Introducing a hosepipe ban is never a
OL,7,Fdecision we take lightly, and we fully
OL,8,Fappreciate the inconvenience it will
OL,9,Fcause," said Richard Stanbrook,
OL,10,Fdirector for drinking water services at
OL,11,FBristol Water.
